      "title": "croft - A VS Code-style TUI Editor in Rust",
      "url": "https://codeberg.org/vitali87/croft",
      "publishedDate": "2026-06-01",
      "readDate": "2026-06-01",
      "language": "en",
      "abstract": "croft is a VS Code-style three-pane workspace that runs entirely inside the terminal. Written in Rust, it provides a powerful and efficient development environment with features like tree-sitter syntax highlighting, inline previews for various file types, and a real interactive shell.",
